What will be the output of this code?

```csharp
using System;

namespace MyApplication
{
    class Program
    {
        static void Main(string[] args)
        {
            int[] num = {10, 4, 2, 20};
            num[1] = 20;
            num[2] = 10;
            Console.Write(num[1]);
        }
    }
}
```

